{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coraroc is a back-to-basics retro platformer! Run, jump and swing\u00a0through finely tuned levels full of collectibles. Your mission: defeat the dastardly Pacicaps, strange invaders who have kidnapped you and your friends for nefarious needs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free your friends, stop the Pacicaps, and regain your peaceful way of life... as Coraroc!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963120/extras/e6a78bd4294c423e91e886d6ffbe7fbc.avif?t=1765041400\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Coraroc?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coraroc is a back-to-basics retro platformer! Run, jump, and swing your way through the world of Plalalalp to save your friends from the Pacicap invaders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963120/extras/f1883fb6df6d23fe28a99cfcb0729823.avif?t=1765041400\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You said that already. What IS Coraroc?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coraroc is Coraroc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963120/extras/a4e16544258cd6b1ad9807e0be726cfb.avif?t=1765041400\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No I mean, are they like\u00a0a snowman marshmallow thing?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coraroc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963120/extras/c4de7c51e9b5728562efde22dfbac1c8.avif?t=1765041400\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features of Coraroc:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive stages packed with secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devious enemies built to challenge and evolve your &quot;swing-tech&quot; capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 20 coins and destroy a hidden satellite within each stage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad controls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating difficulty complementing your &quot;natural skill growth&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage contains a Time Attack mode!\u00a0Each stage contains a  Hard mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A message to the Coraroc-curious with full-time jobs: yes, you can beat this in a weekend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills with 100% completion!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963120?t=1765041400","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963120?t=1765041400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963120/954522725205c3c95f238ba060851d347eb18b86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765041400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963120/954522725205c3c95f238ba060851d347eb18b86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765041400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4220800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coraroc is a back-to-basics retro platformer! Run, jump and swing\u00a0through finely tuned levels full of collectibles. Your mission: defeat the dastardly Pacicaps, strange invaders who have kidnapped you and your friends for nefarious needs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free your friends, stop the Pacicaps, a